Hey, look, man, I don't-I don't
want no trouble, all right?

264
00:17:49,936 --> 00:17:52,338
I'm just passing through.

265
00:17:52,372 --> 00:17:55,841
You looking for them boys?
Them bad boys?

266
00:17:55,875 --> 00:17:59,312
Yeah. Yeah, you seen
which way they went?

267
00:17:59,345 --> 00:18:03,449
Yeah, I seen.
Th-They went that way.

268
00:18:03,483 --> 00:18:05,718
Then they went that way.

269
00:18:05,751 --> 00:18:07,320
Then they went there.

270
00:18:10,556 --> 00:18:13,793
-No.
-I'm sorry.

271
00:18:13,826 --> 00:18:16,562
-I'm just high.

272
00:18:16,596 --> 00:18:18,098
-Nah, man.

273
00:18:18,131 --> 00:18:19,765
Come on. Let me
give you some money.

274
00:18:19,799 --> 00:18:22,035
You can't go to the dance
without no money, boy.

275
00:18:22,068 --> 00:18:24,370
Let old Wally help you out.

276
00:18:24,404 --> 00:18:26,639
Wait. Wait!

277
00:18:26,672 --> 00:18:28,674
Please!

278
00:18:34,680 --> 00:18:36,282
I lost my baby.

279
00:18:36,316 --> 00:18:38,818
What?

280
00:18:41,487 --> 00:18:44,057
Take some ChapStick.

281
00:18:44,090 --> 00:18:47,693
I don't like sharing lip to lip.
You got germs?

282
00:18:50,596 --> 00:18:53,433
Don't follow me, man.

283
00:19:36,476 --> 00:19:38,478
(insects trilling,
leaves fluttering)

284
00:20:16,716 --> 00:20:18,584
Man, will you shut
the hell up, man?

285
00:20:18,618 --> 00:20:21,487
Stop following me!
Take your ass home.

286
00:20:21,521 --> 00:20:25,225
-You in bad shape, boy.

287
00:20:25,258 --> 00:20:27,560
-Oh, shit.

288
00:20:28,861 --> 00:20:30,730
Oh, come on, man.

289
00:20:30,763 --> 00:20:32,565
That's you.

290
00:20:32,598 --> 00:20:35,034
Deer guts.

291
00:20:35,067 --> 00:20:36,936
That's what I'll call you.

292
00:20:36,969 --> 00:20:39,672
Big ol' black-boy deer guts.

293
00:20:42,275 --> 00:20:44,244
You're stubborn.

294
00:20:44,277 --> 00:20:47,913
You're stubborn,
and you're black.

295
00:20:47,947 --> 00:20:49,949
I'm serious, man.
Leave me the fuck alone!

296
00:20:52,918 --> 00:20:55,921
Boy, you is just like your mama.

297
00:20:58,023 --> 00:20:59,058
What?

298
00:21:01,294 --> 00:21:02,928
What's the matter?

299
00:21:02,962 --> 00:21:05,398
You looking all crazy.

300
00:21:08,468 --> 00:21:10,603
Don't think you can out-slip me.

301
00:21:19,945 --> 00:21:22,715
MAN:
Why you sitting?

302
00:21:22,748 --> 00:21:24,817
I'm tired, man.

303
00:21:24,850 --> 00:21:27,086
I'm tired.
I had a very bad day.

304
00:21:42,835 --> 00:21:44,904
Shit.

305
00:21:44,937 --> 00:21:46,306
Ah.

306
00:21:46,339 --> 00:21:48,374
I-I just need to think, man.

307
00:21:48,408 --> 00:21:49,975
Boy...

308
00:21:50,009 --> 00:21:52,978
-ain't nobody could do that.

309
00:21:53,012 --> 00:21:56,482
Nigga, you so damn useless.

310
00:22:00,286 --> 00:22:03,889
You better watch how you
talk to people, deer guts.

311
00:22:03,923 --> 00:22:07,793
You sit around in people's
houses insulting 'em.

312
00:22:10,095 --> 00:22:12,031
You better stand up
and make a decision

313
00:22:12,064 --> 00:22:14,234
about how you
getting out of here.

314
00:22:14,267 --> 00:22:16,869
Nigga, just leave me alone.
Goddamn.

315
00:22:19,305 --> 00:22:21,741
Make the decision.

316
00:22:21,774 --> 00:22:23,376
Nigga...

317
00:22:23,409 --> 00:22:26,312
Keep standing still,

318
00:22:26,346 --> 00:22:29,482
you're gone, boy.

319
00:22:29,515 --> 00:22:32,184
You're wasting time.

320
00:22:32,218 --> 00:22:35,888
And the only people
who got time are dead.

321
00:22:35,921 --> 00:22:39,692
And if you're dead,
I'm gonna take them shoes

322
00:22:39,725 --> 00:22:41,594
and your wallet

323
00:22:41,627 --> 00:22:44,297
and that shirt.

324
00:22:44,330 --> 00:22:46,366
All right.

325
00:22:46,399 --> 00:22:48,768
I...

326
00:22:48,801 --> 00:22:51,136
Okay.

327
00:22:51,170 --> 00:22:54,274
Just...

328
00:22:54,307 --> 00:22:56,809
Shit.

329
00:23:01,747 --> 00:23:03,349
MAN:
I'm-a count to 30,

330
00:23:03,383 --> 00:23:07,119
and if you ain't walked out
of here by then,

331
00:23:07,152 --> 00:23:09,389
I'm gonna hurt you,

332
00:23:09,422 --> 00:23:11,023
'cause ain't nobody out here

333
00:23:11,056 --> 00:23:14,026
but you and me, boy.

334
00:23:15,861 --> 00:23:19,332
One... two... three...

335
00:23:19,365 --> 00:23:21,967
12...

336
00:23:22,001 --> 00:23:24,103
11... 13...

337
00:23:24,136 --> 00:23:28,474
14... 15... 17...

338
00:23:39,585 --> 00:23:41,220
Shit!

339
00:24:51,824 --> 00:24:55,828
KID:
Hey, excuse me.

340
00:24:55,861 --> 00:24:58,898
A

341
00:25:07,206 --> 00:25:09,208
Uh, yeah, man.

342
00:25:11,777 --> 00:25:13,746
Yeah, I'm Paper Boi.

343
00:25:19,151 --> 00:25:21,320
You want a picture?

344
00:25:21,353 --> 00:25:23,122
Come on.

345
00:25:27,827 --> 00:25:29,795
All right. There you go.

346
00:25:29,829 --> 00:25:32,498
-Yeah, yeah. I got it.
-All right.

347
00:25:32,532 --> 00:25:34,800
Ready?

348
00:25:37,336 --> 00:25:39,238
Got to give,
like, a mob face, man.

349
00:25:39,271 --> 00:25:40,773
Yeah.
Do it again.

350
00:25:42,742 --> 00:25:44,677
You got it?
Take another one.

351
00:25:44,710 --> 00:25:46,712
Go ahead.

352
00:25:51,050 --> 00:25:53,285
All right, man.

353
00:25:53,318 --> 00:25:55,287
-Thank you.
-Yep.

354
00:25:55,320 --> 00:25:57,890
Be safe out here.

355
00:27:02,454 --> 00:27:04,423
